      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h1>One method. <em>The whole of you.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">One key a day. Eleven chambers. Nine gates. A coach the whole way. Here is how it works.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu8wP9Jl9fO1d2dqU6Na00">Begin with Vault</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#video" data-watch>Watch the approach video</a></div>
    </div></div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="video" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Start here</p><h2>Meet the Vault Human approach.</h2><p class="lede">Three and a half minutes that could change your year. See how one key a day, a coach beside you, and a clear path through your past, present and future come together.</p></div>
      <div class="vidframe vh-player"><video id="hiw" preload="none" playsinline poster="/img/russ/v2/how-it-works-poster.jpg" aria-label="Vault Human: how it works"></video><button class="vh-play" type="button" aria-label="Play: How the Vault Human approach works"><span class="vh-title">How The Vault Human<br/>Approach Works</span><span class="vh-btn" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="vh-sub">Watch · 3½ minutes</span></button></div>
      <style>.vh-player{position:relative;background:#0d110f}.vh-player video{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;background:#0d110f}.vh-player .vh-play{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:20px;background:rgba(18,23,21,.55);border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .3s}.vh-player .vh-play .vh-btn{width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(143,166,126,.92);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);position:relative;transition:transform .2s}.vh-player .vh-play .vh-btn:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:34px;top:26px;border-style:solid;border-width:16px 0 16px 26px;border-color:transparent transparent transparent #121715}.vh-player .vh-play:hover .vh-btn{transform:scale(1.06)}.vh-player.playing .vh-play{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}.vh-player.playing video{cursor:pointer}.vh-player .vh-play:focus-visible .vh-btn{outline:2px solid #F1EDE4;outline-offset:4px}.vh-player .vh-title{font-family:"Bebas Neue",sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#F1EDE4;transition:transform .2s}.vh-player .vh-play:hover .vh-title{transform:translateY(-2px)}.vh-player .vh-sub{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(241,237,228,.75);font-weight:600}@media(max-width:560px){.vh-player .vh-play{gap:10px}.vh-player .vh-play .vh-btn{width:56px!important;height:56px!important}.vh-player .vh-play .vh-btn:after{left:22px!important;top:16px!important;border-width:12px 0 12px 19px!important}}</style>
      <script is:inline>(function(){var w=document.querySelector('.vh-player');if(!w)return;var v=w.querySelector('video'),b=w.querySelector('.vh-play'),HLS='/video/hiw/hiw.m3u8',MP4='/img/russ/v2/how-it-works.mp4',ready=false;
function go(){v.controls=false;w.classList.add('playing');var p=v.play();if(p&&p.catch)p.catch(function(){});}
function mp4(){v.src=MP4;ready=true;go();}
function load(){if(ready){go();return;}
 if(v.canPlayType('application/vnd.apple.mpegurl')){v.src=HLS;ready=true;go();return;}
 var s=document.createElement('script');s.src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hls.js@1.5.20/dist/hls.min.js';
