    <section class="sec" id="start"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How to start</p><h2>It starts when you say yes.</h2><p class="lede">No big plan. No perfect timing. One yes, and the change has already begun.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Say yes</h3><p>Click Begin. Your first week is free, and saying yes is the hardest step of all.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Your first key arrives</h3><p>Within minutes, your first Vault Key lands in your inbox: a short lesson and one thing to do that day. A new one follows every morning at 7.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Meet your coach</h3><p>In your first week, a short conversation with Russ or a Vault coach. Then a key every morning, one step at a time.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu8wP9Jl9fO1d2dqU6Na00">Yes, I'm in</a></div>
    </div></section>

